'''Ho-Oh ex''' (Japanese: '''ホウオウex''' ''Houou ex'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Basic {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

